    <briefdescription>
<para>Simple RCU-protected hash table for key-value storage. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides lock-free reads and safe concurrent updates using RCU. Optimized for read-heavy workloads (90%+ reads).</para>
<para>Performance characteristics:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Reads: O(1) lock-free</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Writes: O(1) with writer lock</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Memory: Slightly higher due to copy-on-write </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
